## Key Feature Modules

#### 1. Impact & Metrics Header Ribbon
- KPI Readouts: Spoilage Prevented (Tons & %), Fuel/Mileage Saved (-35%), Open-Standard Savings (100% Zero proprietary license fees), Revenue Recovered (₹).
- Real-time IoT simulator controls: Play/Pause simulation, Speed toggle (1x, 5x, 10x), Trigger Emergency Temp Spike button, Add Surplus Cluster modal trigger.

#### 2. Interactive GIS Command Center Map (`/components/gis-map`)
- Leaflet interactive dark map centered on major Indian agricultural corridors (Nashik-Mumbai, Gwalior-Agra, Ariyalur-Chennai, Bhopal-Indore).
- Pulsing surplus cluster nodes (color-coded Tier 1 Red, Tier 2 Amber, Tier 3 Cyan/Emerald).
- Cold-Chain Fleet overlay with active GPS position markers and status indicators.
- TSP optimized multi-stop route polylines connecting farm surplus nodes to target Mandis.
- Node popups with full crop specs, decay score, estimated shelf-life countdown, and action buttons.

#### 3. Predictive Spoilage & Cold-Chain Telemetry Panel (`/components/telemetry`)
- Live sensor readouts: Ambient Core Temp (°C), Humidity (%), Vibration/Transit Health (m/s²), Decay Velocity.
- Dynamic exponential decay calculation engine with real-time alerts when ambient temp exceeds $8^\circ\text{C}$.
- Interactive Recharts graphs showing temperature history vs projected shelf-life decay curve.

#### 4. Multi-Tier Autonomous Dispatch & Decision Engine (`/components/dispatch`)
- Kanban/Card boards grouped by dispatch tiers:
  - **Tier 1 (Critical / <24h shelf-life):** Auto-reroute to closest Mandi + trigger Flash Clearance Sale.
  - **Tier 2 (Moderate / 24–72h):** AI-optimized cold-chain truck priority dispatch.
  - **Tier 3 (Standard / >72h):** Standard cooperative warehouse transit.
- 2-Opt TSP solver interface: Displays distance matrices, optimized stop sequences, transit time saved, and diesel fuel reduction (~35%).

#### 5. Rescue Flash Clearance Portal (`/components/flash-portal`)
- Dynamic B2B Mandi / Wholesale clearance cards with automated price slashes based on decay score & overproduction margin.
- Expiration countdown timers, location badges, crop quality metrics.
- 1-Click Wholesale Reserve/Purchase modal generating digital manifest & QR verification code.

#### 6. IoT Telemetry Simulator & API Handlers (`/app/api/`)
- API Route Handlers for `/api/telemetry`, `/api/dispatch`, `/api/clusters`, `/api/clearance`.
- Background simulation engine providing live updates to temperature, vibration, decay rates, and truck positions.

